{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL1NhYXlhJTIwJTI4MjAwMyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Saaya","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gsbI2smESxO0JExRbawfZSYJwSa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nm56Ucx46AiwGN02RJDhKn2QceG.jpg","description":"Tanya is a rich woman who is married to another rich man named Vinod. But their lives change by Vinod's death. Tanya than starts falling in love with a doctor named Akash. But Akash is in love with a woman named Maya and after some time gets married to her. But their marriage does not last long. Because, first Maya leaves him to travel to another part of India to help people who are sick; and then Akash receives news that she is dead. Tanya comes up to console Akash and hopes that he will now love, accept and marry her. But Akash does not do so, as he is still immersed in Maya's memories, and believes that Maya is still alive and calling out to him. Is Akash going out of his mind?\n\nRated UA · Released 4 Jul 2003 · India · Language: Hindi · 122 min\nStudio: Vishesh Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Mystery","Horror","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.9","runtime":"122 min","cast":["John Abraham","Tara Sharma","Mahima Chaudhry","Zohra Sehgal","Raj Zutshi","Shreya Ghoshal","Akshita Mutreja","Sadiya Siddiqui"],"director":["Anurag Basu"],"released":"2003-07-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Can love call back the dead?","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anurag Basu","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o1hGaRlxLaPrJ0CIhm6fMtmrudb.jpg"},{"name":"John Abraham","character":"Dr. Akash \"Akki\" Bhatnagar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xqOzxrbBkgbzT0pgAR2k03Hvd30.jpg"},{"name":"Tara Sharma","character":"Dr. Maya Bhatnagar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4kO4vzyZosFrELvZjCM0MkNYYGH.jpg"},{"name":"Mahima Chaudhry","character":"Tanya","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185